      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229692/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease a deep casserole dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D3wnooZb2b6cjAafVB9134j06pc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-229692-Easy-Sweet-Potato-Casserole-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-d82ee6279424447895d4233ef1afd917.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229692/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash sweet potatoes with a potato masher in a bowl until no large lumps remain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
